  <h2>Purpose</h2>
  <p>
    This document explains the current orilto.ai web app in a structure that is easy
    for humans, Word processors, and AI tools to read. Keep this file updated whenever
    the website structure, brand position, copy, build workflow, or deployment workflow changes.
  </p>

