  <h2>Notes For Future AI Assistants</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Do not edit files inside node_modules.</li>
    <li>Primary content changes should usually be made in src/App.jsx.</li>
    <li>Primary visual changes should usually be made in src/App.css or src/index.css.</li>
    <li>Update this AI_README.doc whenever meaningful changes are made.</li>
    <li>Use npm.cmd run build on this Windows/PowerShell environment if npm.ps1 execution is blocked.</li>
    <li>Push routine work to develop only unless the user explicitly asks for main.</li>
    <li>The current app is mostly static content and does not use routing or a backend.</li>
    <li>The contact form uses mailto and does not submit to a server.</li>
  </ul>
